sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client Connection Fiber
    participant SF as ServerFamily
    participant BG as bg_save_fiber
    participant SC as SaveStagesController
    participant T as SAVE Transaction
    participant S0 as EngineShard 0
    participant S1 as EngineShard 1
    participant SS0 as SliceSnapshot Fiber 0
    participant SS1 as SliceSnapshot Fiber 1
    participant OUT as SnapshotStorage / files

    C->>SF: BGSAVE
    SF->>SC: DoSaveCheckAndStart: Init + Start
    SC->>T: ScheduleSingleHop(start snapshots)
    par shard 0
      T->>S0: SaveDfsSingle / StartInShard
      S0->>SS0: SliceSnapshot::Start
      SS0->>OUT: serialized chunks
    and shard 1
      T->>S1: SaveDfsSingle / StartInShard
      S1->>SS1: SliceSnapshot::Start
      SS1->>OUT: serialized chunks
    end
    SF->>BG: launch BgSaveFb, transaction intrusive_ptr 保活
    SF-->>C: OK
    BG->>SC: WaitAllSnapshots
    SC->>OUT: summary/body、close、rename tmp
    BG->>SC: Finalize
